  </p>

  <component-demo component="textbox" variant="base/prefix"/>

  <h3 id="textbox-postfix">Textbox Postfix</h3>
  <p>
    Add a <code>span</code> containing text after the input to show it as a
    postfix text.
  </p>

  <component-demo component="textbox" variant="base/suffix"/>

  <h3 id="textbox-mixed-prefix-postfix">Mixed icons and static text</h3>
  <p>Postfix/prefix icons can be mixed with static text in the textbox.</p>

